    "name": "Python3 program to find",
    "code": "# Python3 program to find\n# maximum equilibrium sum.\nimport sys\n \n# Function to find\n# maximum equilibrium sum.\ndef findMaxSum(arr,n):\n     \n    ss = sum(arr)\n    prefix_sum = 0\n    res = -sys.maxsize\n     \n    for i in range(n):\n        prefix_sum += arr[i]\n         \n        if prefix_sum == ss:\n            res = max(res, prefix_sum);\n             \n        ss -= arr[i];\n         \n    return res\n  \n# Driver code  \nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n     \n    arr = [ -2, 5, 3, 1,\n             2, 6, -4, 2 ]\n    n = len(arr)\n     \n    print(findMaxSum(arr, n))\n \n# This code is contributed by rutvik_56",
